{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10523","headline":"酬河南节度使贺兰大夫见赠之作 · 高适","name":"酬河南节度使贺兰大夫见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁凭栏槛，中军倚斾旌。\n感时常激切，於己即忘情。\n河华屯妖气，伊瀍有战声。\n媿无戡难策，多谢出师名。\n秉钺知恩重，临戎觉命轻。\n股肱瞻列岳，唇齿赖长城。\n隐隐摧锋势，光光弄印荣。\n鲁连真义士，陆逊岂书生。\n直道宁殊智，先鞭忽抗行。\n楚云随去马，淮月尚连营。\n抚劒堪投分，悲歌益不平。\n从来重然诺，况值欲横行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}